      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW REX (6) last seen when scorching around the 390m at this track in 21.92 for a 12 length win. In form and looks the one to beat again. BUSH PROFIT (4) flew the lids and led throughout to score a most impressive win by 6 lengths at this track over 390m (22.06). Solid record here at the distance winning eight races. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Expected to measure up again. PRINCETOWN FLYER (1) filled a minor placing last start at Mt Gambier behind Trading Halt (23.37) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to be in this for a long way. CHEEKY ALESSIA (2) has top-three aspirations after placing last time.",
